<p>You fire a shot without putting much strength into it, doing <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">76%, 87%, 96%, 103%, 110%</acronym> damage.</p><p>That brief moment of relief allows you to regain <acronym class="talent-variable" title="Values for<br>talent levels 1-5,<br>talent mastery 1.00">20, 28, 36, 44, 52</acronym> stamina.</p>